OL,3,GNEWSA'Drought grants for farmers are
OL,4,Akind but won't go far'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer has said grants of up to
OL,7,F#2,000 for those hit by drought over
OL,8,Fthe summer are "better than nothing"
OL,9,Fbut warned more help is needed.
OL,11,FThe money is coming from a #2m fund set
OL,12,Fup by the Royal Agricultural Benevolent
OL,13,FInstitution (RABI) to help eligible
OL,14,Ffarming households meet personal and
OL,15,Fhousehold living costs.
OL,17,FIt comes after the UK experienced its
OL,18,Fhottest summer on record and droughts
OL,19,Fwere declared in much of the south of
OL,20,FEngland.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
