OL,3,GNEWSA'Drought grants for farmers are
OL,4,Akind but won't go far'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRABI, which is a charity, said it hoped
OL,7,Fthe money would "provide a good couple
OL,8,Fof months of support, if not longer".
